{
 "schema": "lab2shot.graph/1",
 "meta": {
  "id": "ca05f8c58cebeb4960131f1cc47eb001",
  "name": {
   "zh": "网格 · Open3D",
   "en": "Mesh · Open3D"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "把视频解算成摄影机和逐帧深度（ViPE：摄影机移动、旋转都解得稳），融合成全局点云，再转成三角网格（USD）：Poisson 水密光滑、Ball Pivoting 按球半径滚球成面、Alpha Shape 按 Alpha 值取凸包与贴合之间一档。「方法」选算法，其余参数按方法显示。",
   "en": "Solves the video into cameras and per-frame depth (ViPE: stable for moving and rotating cameras), fuses them into a global point cloud and turns it into a triangle mesh (USD): Poisson is watertight and smooth, Ball Pivoting rolls a ball of Ball Radius to make faces, and Alpha Shape takes a step between convex hull and tight fit by Alpha Value. Method chooses the algorithm; the other parameters show according to the method."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-10-02T00:00:00",
  "deliverable": "points_mesh",
  "owner": "admin",
  "updated": "2026-10-03T20:00:00"
 },
